# {{ title }}

{{ summary }}

Built with **[Potato](https://www.potatoannotator.com)**, an open-source
annotation platform for NLP, agentic and GenAI research, configured entirely
through YAML.

{% if backup_repo %}
Annotations are backed up to `{{ backup_repo }}` every {{ backup_minutes }}
minutes. A Space's filesystem does not survive a rebuild or a restart, so that
dataset — not this Space — is where the data actually lives.
{% else %}
> **Annotations here are not backed up.** A Space's filesystem is wiped on
> rebuild and on restart, so anything collected is lost when either happens.
> Deploy with a HuggingFace token to mirror annotations into a Dataset repo.
{% endif %}

## Running it yourself

```bash
pip install potato-annotation
potato start {{ config_rel }} -p 8000
```

Deployed with `potato deploy up {{ config_rel }} --provider huggingface`.
